75532>>>>>External_Function WNetGetUserW "WNetGetUserW" MPR.DLL ;    Pointer lpName ;    Pointer lpUser_Name ;    Pointer lpLength ;    Returns DWord
75533>>>>>
75533>>>>>// Wrapper Function WNetGetUser
75533>>>>>Function WNetGetUser Global ;    Pointer lpName ;    Pointer lpUser_Name ;    Pointer lpLength ;    Returns DWord
75535>>>>>    
75535>>>>>    DWord   dwResult     
75535>>>>>    UWide   uwName uwUserName
75535>>>>>    UWide   uwName uwUserName
75535>>>>>        
75535>>>>>    Send StringToWide lpName (&uwName)
75536>>>>>    
75536>>>>>    Send WideSetBuffer lpUser_Name lpLength (&uwUserName)    
75537>>>>>    
75537>>>>>    Move (WNetGetUserW (uwName.lpUText, uwUserName.lpUText, lpLength)) to dwResult
75538>>>>>    
75538>>>>>    Send WideToString (&uwUserName) lpUser_Name
75539>>>>>    
75539>>>>>    Function_Return dwResult
75540>>>>>End_Function
