75541>>>>>//    This function reads the current username Of windows and returns that
75541>>>>>//    name or an text unknown user
75541>>>>>Function Network_User_Name for cDesktop Returns String
75543>>>>>    WString wName
75543>>>>>    Integer iRetval iLength
75543>>>>>    
75543>>>>>    Move 0 to iLength
75544>>>>>    Move (WNetGetUserW (0, 0, AddressOf (iLength))) to iRetval
75545>>>>>    Move (ZeroString(iLength)) to wName
75546>>>>>    Move (WNetGetUserW (0, AddressOf (wName), AddressOf (iLength))) to iRetval
75547>>>>>    
75547>>>>>    If (iRetval = NO_ERROR) Begin
75549>>>>>        Function_Return (CString (wName))
75550>>>>>    End
75550>>>>>>
75550>>>>>    
75550>>>>>    Function_Return "User Unknown"
75551>>>>>End_Function
