75733>>>>>    Function CKRevisionNumber String sDriverID Returns String
75735>>>>>        Handle hoCLIHandler
75735>>>>>        Handle hoDFBtrDrvHandler
75735>>>>>        String sCKRevision
75735>>>>>        
75735>>>>>        
75735>>>>>        If (sDriverID = "MSSQLDRV" or sDriverID = "ODBC_DRV" or sDriverID = "DB2_DRV") Begin
75737>>>>>            Get Create (RefClass(cCLIHandler)) to hoCLIHandler
75738>>>>>            Set psDriverID of hoCLIHandler to sDriverID
75739>>>>>            Move (CKRevision(hoCLIHandler)) to sCKRevision
75740>>>>>            Send Destroy of hoCLIHandler
75741>>>>>        End
75741>>>>>>
75741>>>>>        Else Begin
75742>>>>>            If (sDriverID = "DFBTRDRV") Begin
75744>>>>>                Get Create (RefClass(cDFBtrDrvHandler)) to hoDFBtrDrvHandler
75745>>>>>                Set psDriverID of hoDFBtrDrvHandler to sDriverID
75746>>>>>                Move (CKRevision(hoDFBtrDrvHandler)) to sCKRevision
75747>>>>>                Send Destroy of hoDFBtrDrvHandler
75748>>>>>            End
75748>>>>>>
75748>>>>>        End
75748>>>>>>
75748>>>>>        
75748>>>>>        Function_Return sCKRevision
75749>>>>>    End_Function
