76114>>>>>    //  Validates if the field contains a valid email address (it allows empty values too).
76114>>>>>    Function ValidateEmail Integer iColumn String sValue Returns Boolean
76116>>>>>        Integer iAt iDot
76116>>>>>        Boolean bResult
76116>>>>>        
76116>>>>>        If (Trim(sValue) <> "") Begin
76118>>>>>            Move (Pos("@", sValue)) to iAt
76119>>>>>            Move (RightPos(".", sValue)) to iDot
76120>>>>>            
76120>>>>>            If (not(iAt > 1 and iDot > 0 and iDot > iAt + 1 and iDot < Length(sValue))) Begin
76122>>>>>                Send Data_set_error iColumn DFERR_OPERATOR "Please enter a valid email address"
76123>>>>>                Move True to bResult
76124>>>>>            End
76124>>>>>>
76124>>>>>        End
76124>>>>>>
76124>>>>>        
76124>>>>>        Function_Return bResult
76125>>>>>    End_Function
76126>>>>>    
76126>>>>>End_Class
